       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      * from a question on IBM Community
         PROGRAM-ID. JPARSEZ.
       DATA DIVISION.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 JSON-CLIENT-DATA.
        03 PIC X(02) value '{'.
        03 PIC X(11) value ' "CLIENT":{'.
        03 PIC X(18) value ' "CLIENTID": 1047,'.
        03 PIC X(22) value ' "CLIENTNAME": "Alice"'.
        03 PIC X(04) value '},'.
        03 PIC X(18) value ' "TRANSACTIONS": ['.
        03 PIC X(42) value ' {"DATE": "2026-10-01", "AMOUNT": 100},'.
        03 PIC X(41) value ' {"DATE": "2026-10-02", "AMOUNT": 20}'.
        03 PIC X(03) value '  ]'.
        03 PIC X(01) value '}'.

       01 JSON-UTF8 PIC X(1000) value is all x'20'.

       01  CLIENT-DATA.
          03 CLIENT.
             05 CLIENTID      PIC 9(9).
             05 CLIENTNAME    PIC X(50).
          03 TRANSACTIONS OCCURS 2 TIMES.
             05 TRANDATE      PIC X(10).
             05 TRANAMOUNT    PIC 9(5).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "JSON-CLIENT-DATA" JSON-CLIENT-DATA
           JSON PARSE JSON-UTF8 INTO CLIENT-DATA
              WITH DETAIL
                NAME OF CLIENT-DATA IS OMITTED
                        TRANDATE IS "DATE"
                        TRANAMOUNT IS "AMOUNT"
                ON EXCEPTION
                     DISPLAY "Error parsing JSON data."
                     DISPLAY "JSON CODE: " JSON-CODE
                     DISPLAY "JSON STATUS: " JSON-STATUS
                     STOP RUN
                 NOT ON EXCEPTION
                     DISPLAY "Successful JSON Parse"
           END-JSON.

           Display "Client Information: "
           Display "  ID:   "  CLIENTID
           Display "  NAME: "  CLIENTNAME

           Display "Transactions:"
           Display "  Record 1:"
           Display "    DATE:   " TRANDATE(1)
           Display "    AMOUNT: " TRANAMOUNT(1)

           Display "  Record 2:"
           Display "    DATE:   " TRANDATE(2)
           Display "    AMOUNT: " TRANAMOUNT(2)

           Goback.
       End program JPARSEZ.

